              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dok i kom doggola me kicika maditte onoŋo gigoro iye cal lukerubi ki cal yadi otit, kit macalo onoŋo koŋ gigoro i kor ot me kicika ducu-ni. Ki yo tuŋ woko onoŋo tye iye bolo me bao me geŋo tipo ma tye i nyim doggola me donyo. ",
          "type": "text",
